WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.570
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:14.910
The two of them have really piled up the points.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:19.410
It's getting hard to tell who'll make the Final Tournament.

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.790
It's clutch time, Mahiru.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.920
I know. That's why I'm thinking of entering this Fest.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.250
Hustle Idol?

00:00:29.250 --> 00:00:34.510
It's worth a lot of points, which attracts more competitors and ups the difficulty.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:38.220
Still, it's the last chance I've got to make the top four.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.100
I swear I'll make it in!

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:44.640
Hey, hey! You should totally enter this Fest, Aria.

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:50.110
If you get first here, you'll definitely make it into the Final Tournament!

00:00:50.900 --> 00:00:51.860
Hoyo...

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:57.910
"Hoyo"...? Aria, your rank is super good right now! Do you understand that?

00:00:58.320 --> 00:00:59.370
Hoyoyo?

00:00:59.370 --> 00:01:02.160
Someone'll pass you if you don't get serious!

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.620
And wouldn't that be baad?

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:07.130
I don't really get it.

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:10.300
I just love doing fun Aikatsu!

00:02:57.490 --> 00:02:59.860
<i>Not yet, I'm still not good enough!</i>

00:02:59.860 --> 00:03:01.450
<i>You have to hustle, Mahiru!</i>

00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:06.950
Onee-chan?

00:03:07.870 --> 00:03:08.620
Hello—

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.000
Bonjour!

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:12.250
Mahiru, ça va?

00:03:12.250 --> 00:03:15.130
I'm doing ça va, ça va over here!

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:17.800
You sound well. What's up?

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:22.470
I got the feeling you'd be wanting to hear my voice pretty soon.

00:03:22.470 --> 00:03:24.100
What's that supposed to mean?

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:27.390
So, how are things?

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.640
I've got a really important Fest coming up.

00:03:30.640 --> 00:03:32.980
It's going to directly impact my future.

00:03:34.110 --> 00:03:37.070
Elza-san acquired her Sun Dress.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:40.490
But dresses alone don't decide the fight.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.360
That's exactly right.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:47.620
It falls upon the wearer to draw out its unlimited reserves of radiance.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:53.040
I can't draw out the full brilliance of my Neptune Coord as I am now.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:55.080
I'll need to become my ultimate self. {this is what I came up with instead of perfect}

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.920
You're the same as always.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.210
I guess so.

00:03:58.210 --> 00:04:00.380
But it makes me feel sorry.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.130
Huh?

00:04:01.130 --> 00:04:06.010
I love you the way you are now too.

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:07.390
Bye now.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.560
She feels sorry? What does that mean?

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.230
I don't have time to waste thinking about it.

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:19.400
There's only one thing I have to do right now!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.650
Where's Elza-sama?

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.820
She should be arriving shortly.

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:31.000
Good morning, Elza-sama!

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:32.040
Morning.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:33.750
Good morning!

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.920
Good day. I'll take breakfast in my room.

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:39.380
Understood, I will deliver it shortly.

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.380
Wait, why?

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.180
Elza-sama, you're such a stubborn-face.{actually I like this but}

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:47.390
She'll understand in due time.

00:04:47.390 --> 00:04:49.260
I suppose you're right.

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:52.390
After all, she must be lonely by herself.

00:05:00.780 --> 00:05:02.860
Aikatsu.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:07.490
Aikatsu.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.660
M-Mahiru-chan?

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.700
Aikatsu while eating?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:20.210
Aria-chan?

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.750
Mahiru-san!

00:05:22.130 --> 00:05:23.380
You came to visit?

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:26.300
Yes, I was hoping to run into Hime-chan.

00:05:26.300 --> 00:05:27.470
I see.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.760
If I may, what's that?

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:34.640
Oh, this is Four Star Academy's 
traditional Lun Lun Body Maker.

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:39.650
Wearing it while training will build muscle in all the right places to give you an ideal body.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.280
It looks like fun!

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.360
Want to try one, Aria-chan?

00:05:44.690 --> 00:05:45.820
Yes!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:57.540
It's not... it's very not fun.

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.540
Really?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.380
Yes...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.000
So it's not fun, huh.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.420
I wonder what fun is, anyway.

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.260
It's when your heart feels elated.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:11.260
A smile comes to your face, and you can't help but want to dance.

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:15.140
Performing on stage is the most fun thing ever!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:21.020
But this isn't like that. This just hurts.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.770
You're right about that.

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:26.990
So why is it that you can do things like this?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.570
Why? Maybe because I'm serious.

00:06:30.570 --> 00:06:32.030
Serious?

00:06:32.030 --> 00:06:36.330
Because I'm serious, I don't want to lose, 
and because I don't want to lose, I can work hard.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:40.040
It's my goal to place first in the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:06:43.130 --> 00:06:47.550
With that on the table, what do you think of this new idea, Aria-chan?

00:06:49.510 --> 00:06:50.640
Aria-chan?

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.180
I can't Lun Lun!

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:57.810
Um... I'm sorry.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.980
So that's what happened.

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:06.230
Mahiru-san was very cool.

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:09.860
But I still don't understand what she means when she says she's "serious".

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:15.910
I've never felt the urge to beat anyone else either.

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:19.870
Is it wrong just to want to have fun?

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:25.250
It's not wrong at all. In fact, it's a precious feeling you mustn't ever forget.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:30.010
Still, I want to know what it means to be serious.

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.590
In that case, there's only one thing to do.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:36.760
What?! A mountain retreat?!

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:39.980
I mean, it's something I could see you doing...

00:07:39.980 --> 00:07:41.850
Are you sure you'll be okay?

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:46.690
I only have three days until the Fest. I need to perfect myself, and I can't falter now.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:48.980
I want to go too!

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:51.320
Please take me with you!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.240
Aria-chan, Hime-senpai!

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:56.450
I have a bit of a request.

00:07:56.450 --> 00:08:00.250
Please allow me to learn from your Aikatsu, Mahiru-san!

00:08:03.670 --> 00:08:09.510
Fine. Just be aware that this training will be dangerous if you go in half-heartedly.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.760
Are you prepared?

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:12.590
Yes!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:21.890
W-Wait!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.420
I'll be in your care!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.920
I'll be in your care!

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:55.930
To put it simply, the reason I came here was to hone my five senses.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.680
Five senses? What are those?

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:04.560
Sight, hearing, smell, touch, and taste. {it's always bothered me how hearing is different}{me too}

00:09:04.560 --> 00:09:08.190
By becoming one with nature, I can strengthen each of them.

00:09:10.520 --> 00:09:12.320
You lost me.

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:15.820
I think it's something you just have to experience for yourself.

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:19.070
With that said, osu!

00:09:19.070 --> 00:09:20.450
Osu!

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:41.010
<i>I am not mistaken.</i>

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.810
<i>This is the path I have envisioned.</i>

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:46.270
Watch me.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:50.060
I swear I will make it to the end. {always reminds me of Charlotte}{how often does this happen}

00:10:13.380 --> 00:10:14.300
Yes!

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:17.470
You're superhuman! Very superhuman!

00:10:17.470 --> 00:10:19.430
How did you do that?

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:22.890
I used all five of my senses to feel the boulder's pulse.

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:24.180
Pulse?

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:27.850
This is a pulse.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.060
Can you hear it?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:34.440
Everything has a pulse.

00:10:34.940 --> 00:10:36.490
Now, give it a try.

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:37.440
Osu!

00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:54.630
I couldn't feel it at all!

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:00.840
Okay!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:06.640
Me too!

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:14.190
I couldn't grab any!

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:17.280
Your technique isn't half bad. One more time!

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.440
Osu!

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:35.130
Impossible... it's very impossible!

00:11:45.680 --> 00:11:47.470
Nice! Let's go again!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:49.680
You sure are motivated.

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.060
How couldn't I be?

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:54.440
I bet Aria-chan and Mahiru-chan are working even harder right now.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:57.940
Mahiru's idea of training could wear anyone out.

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:01.610
But Aria-chan's trying to discover something important about herself.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:04.240
And that inspires me to do my best!

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.370
Me too!

00:12:13.920 --> 00:12:16.040
I'm sorry, I just...

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.130
Even I understand it's ridiculous.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:23.430
But that's exactly why it's worth doing.

00:12:23.430 --> 00:12:26.260
I can't surpass myself if I'm only having fun.

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:31.430
I want to do it, no matter how much it hurts. I'll defeat myself.

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:38.690
Please let me try again!

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:39.900
Okay.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:02.920
I got one...

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.260
That's amazing!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.930
It was only one, but...

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.310
I'm happy! I'm very happy!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:11.470
Good!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.270
This is where we'll conduct our final training.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.690
The last one...

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:22.190
It's the heart that bears everything the five senses feel.

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:25.740
The final step is to strengthen the heart and become our ultimate selves.

00:13:26.280 --> 00:13:27.660
Osu!

00:13:35.410 --> 00:13:38.040
<i>This is more intense than I expected.</i>

00:13:38.040 --> 00:13:40.840
<i>But I swear I'll endure it!</i>

00:13:50.850 --> 00:13:55.060
<i>That's it. I need to be as serious as Mahiru-san!</i>

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.320
<i>I can't surpass myself if I'm only having fun.</i>

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:09.490
<i>I want to do it, no matter how much it hurts.</i>

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.160
Are you okay?

00:14:15.160 --> 00:14:16.750
I'm sorry.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:20.500
I'm worthless. I'm completely worthless!

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:22.290
That's not true at all!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:23.170
But—

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:27.340
If you talk like that, I'd feel sorry for the Aria-chan who worked so hard until now!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.510
<i>But it makes me feel sorry.</i>

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.430
<i>Huh?</i>

00:14:32.430 --> 00:14:37.310
<i>I love you the way you are now too.</i>

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.020
So that's it.

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.440
Are you okay?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.120
I'm frustrated! I'm very frustrated!

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:56.700
I've never felt this way before.

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:00.460
That's proof that you're serious.

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.750
I'm serious?

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:04.800
Yeah. The more serious you are, 
the more frustrating it is.

00:15:05.750 --> 00:15:06.920
And also...

00:15:07.550 --> 00:15:10.300
You aren't worthless.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:13.720
Be sure to recognize yourself for everything you've done.

00:15:16.520 --> 00:15:18.430
This one's for me.

00:15:18.980 --> 00:15:22.100
Yes... I will, Master!

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:27.860
I want to Aikatsu even more! Serious Aikatsu! {this was my mistake}

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:31.860
Then I've got the perfect idea!

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:42.920
The venue is packed as fans wait to see how today's Fest will impact the outcome of the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.210
I can't believe Aria entered too.

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:48.130
I had no idea.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:53.180
The winner of this could make it into the top four of the Aikatsu Ranking.

00:15:53.180 --> 00:15:54.010
Yeah.

00:15:59.640 --> 00:16:03.150
As I stand today, I know I can do this.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.570
I'll make you shine brighter than ever before!

00:17:32.650 --> 00:17:34.740
She's so much more radiant than before!

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.780
I know, it's unbelievable how much she's changed!

00:17:37.780 --> 00:17:40.830
It must be the result of her mountain retreat!

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:43.160
You're amazing, Mahiru-chan!

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:49.880
Master, please watch me and my serious Aikatsu!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:55.420
Futaba Aria—May the flower of Aikatsu bloom!

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:19.410
Dresses are a charm for beauty!

00:21:09.990 --> 00:21:11.700
Master!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:17.210
I've never felt this excited on stage before in my entire life!

00:21:17.210 --> 00:21:20.710
I had fun! It was so very fun!

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:25.590
Me too! Training with you allowed me to realize something important.

00:21:25.590 --> 00:21:26.800
Thank you.

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:33.600
It looks like Aria-chan found it.

00:21:33.600 --> 00:21:38.270
Yes. A new kind of fun that comes from being serious.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:42.860
It's time to announce the results.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:45.860
The winner of the Hustle Idol Fest is...

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:57.460
Four Star Academy's Kasumi Mahiru-san!

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:00.380
Thank you!

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:10.640
<i>I knew you could do it, Master!</i>

00:22:14.390 --> 00:22:16.940
Now it's finally settled.

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:18.020
Yeah.

00:22:18.020 --> 00:22:22.820
<i>The top four of the Aikatsu Ranking are going to be announced!</i>

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:58.660
I want to do even more serious Aikatsu!

00:23:58.660 --> 00:24:01.330
Being serious makes you shine even brighter!

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:05.210
I want to make my Star Wings even more ebullient through my Aikatsu.{I'm leaving this just because it's in the not-kakugen section}

00:24:05.210 --> 00:24:09.170
As I stand now, I'm sure I can do the best Aikatsu in the world!

00:24:10.800 --> 00:24:14.180
It's the Final Tournament lineup and bean throwing!

00:24:14.180 --> 00:24:16.050
Plus a performance by S4!

00:24:16.050 --> 00:24:17.810
Wait, what are we talking about?

00:24:17.810 --> 00:24:19.970
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:22.060
Our Episode Solo.

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.310
Become the first-star idol!
